OL,3,ARoyal family rift after popular TV news
OL,4,Apresenter chosen to succeed Ugandan
OL,5,Aking
OL,6,
OL,7,FA bitter succession dispute has erupted
OL,8,Fin one of Uganda's traditional
OL,9,Fkingdoms, days before the burial of its
OL,10,Flate king, who until his death had been
OL,11,Fthe world's youngest reigning monarch.
OL,13,FKing Oyo Nyimba Kabamba Iguru Rukidi
OL,14,FIV, who ruled the Tooro Kingdom for
OL,15,Fmore than three decades, was undergoing
OL,16,Fcancer treatment in the US when he died
OL,17,Flast month aged 34.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
